[ti:Chhod ke mahal-chubare raja ban gaya]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:36.67]Chhod ke mahal-chubare raja, ban gaya jogi aaj re,
[00:51.01]Urvashi bijli ban ke udgi, tootta sakal samaj re!
[01:34.01]Teen vachan ki dori tooti, Kharoshthi ki rekha...
[01:48.35]Nagn dekh liya Apsara ne, Pururava ne maut ko dekha!
[02:17.02]Akhand-Siddham! Akhand-Siddham!
[02:31.36]9 Lipiyon ka jaal hai, O.I. (Original Intelligence) ka kaal hai!
[02:45.69]Tathastu! Tathastu! Tathastu!
[03:14.36]Mullai nilam viraham... Urvashi maraivu...
[03:28.70]Pururava-vin thuyaram, akshara-sara sangamam!
[04:11.70]...Siddham.
